    "index.hero.title": "Your own assistant.<br>Runs at home,<br><span class=\"accent\">answers to you.</span>",
    "index.hero.lead": "Give Cedar a task: research, documents, trips, your finances. It plans the work, does it in a sealed box, and shows you where every answer came from. Nothing leaves your computer unless you say so.",
