    "index.does.privateChat.title": "Private chats, gone when you leave",
    "index.does.privateChat.body": "For something you want neither remembered nor kept. A private chat is in no list, search or inbox. Cedar brings nothing from memory into it and saves nothing from it, and it is deleted with its files when you leave it. On the web and in the phone apps.",
    "index.does.privateChat.p1": "In no list, search or inbox",
