    "index.does.trusted.title": "Trusted execution, in containers and OpenShell",
    "index.does.trusted.body": "Whatever the model runs, it runs in a container of the conversation's own, with no network unless you allow one. On Linux and macOS you can turn on NVIDIA OpenShell, which checks every connection: which program wants to reach which host. What it refuses, Cedar reports and asks you about.",
