    "index.private.lead": "Most assistants run in someone else's cloud. Cedar runs at home, and treats every task like a stranger in the house.",
    "index.private.local.title": "Stays on your machine",
    "index.private.local.body": "The model, your conversations and your files live on your machine. No account needed, nothing to subscribe to.",
    "index.private.box.title": "Each chat in a sealed box",
    "index.private.box.body": "Every conversation gets its own workspace that can't see your documents, your photos or the internet unless you allow it. Between messages it sleeps; delete the chat and the box is gone.",
    "index.private.ask.title": "Asks before anything risky",
    "index.private.ask.body": "Sending an email, downloading a file, deleting something: Cedar stops and asks. You approve once, or always, or never.",
    "index.yours.eyebrow": "Yours to shape",
    "index.yours.title": "Pick the brain.<br>Add the hands.",
    "index.yours.models": "Cedar isn't tied to one AI company. Run a model on your Mac or PC with <strong>Ollama</strong> or <strong>LM Studio</strong>, serve one from a Linux GPU box with <strong>vLLM</strong>, or point it at a server you trust. Switch between them per conversation.",
    "index.yours.tools": "Need something specific? Add a tool from the community with one click, after seeing exactly what it asks for. The first one reads an insulin pump and compares your day with your week.",
