    "index.apps.lead": "Pick the computer that does the work: a Mac, a Windows PC or a Linux box at home. Whichever it is, Cedar for iPhone or Android pairs with it and keeps up: the same conversations, maps and charts, a question when it needs one, and a notification when a task finishes while you're out.",
